{"source": "https://api.github.com/repos/nikitakarpei/yacy-rwi-node/commits?path=doc/adr/0007-use-nats-jetstream-for-node-crawler-queue.md&sha=e8f247a23fb09908c29542c8643156e8926c5fd7&per_page=100", "body": [{"sha": "e8f247a23fb09908c29542c8643156e8926c5fd7", "node_id": "C_kwDOS-6Qm9oAKGU4ZjI0N2EyM2ZiMDk5MDhjMjk1NDJjODY0MzE1NmU4OTI2YzVmZDc", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Nikita Karpei", "email": "nikitakarpei@mailbox.org", "date": "2026-06-22T17:38:29Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Nikita Karpei", "email": "nikitakarpei@mailbox.org", "date": "2026-06-22T17:38:29Z"}, "message": "Extract node implementation into yacynode gowork module\n\nMove the node implementation (internal slices, cmd binaries, e2e suite, and\ndocs) out of the tooling root module into a dedicated yacynode module so the\nnode's runtime dependency graph is isolated from the workspace's lint/build\ntooling. Rewrite internal import paths, repoint .go-arch-lint.yml components,\nthe Makefile module loop and targets, the Dockerfile build path, and the e2e\nmodule's relative replace paths. The e2e suite stays a separate GOWORK=off\nmodule, so its docker/testcontainers dependencies remain confined to its own\ngo.mod and never enter the node binary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "tree": {"sha": "b2f0219b074145fc29e755d681d2338394ca0bbb", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nikitakarpei/my-yacy-node/git/trees/b2f0219b074145fc29e755d681d2338394ca0bbb"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nikitakarpei/my-yacy-node/git/commits/e8f247a23fb09908c29542c8643156e8926c5fd7", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxmCz4yZ3RDvGXOMWwXKqxEJ2SrAUCajlzFQAKCRCwXKqxEJ2S\nrOjdAQDS5OjOY4xEmD6vcYJwzvpMevIsrlPtMJ+hNcLxGUos3QEAjSA7Tqm81ZVm\n5KfWKR2xVFvK76gSoBir9uIi9Jlmvgg=\n=mNZw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----", "payload": "tree b2f0219b074145fc29e755d681d2338394ca0bbb\nparent 65119d1700475270f4c89d7a11c60aaff156dd0a\nauthor Nikita Karpei <nikitakarpei@mailbox.org> 1782149909 +0300\ncommitter Nikita Karpei <nikitakarpei@mailbox.org> 1782149909 +0300\n\nExtract node implementation into yacynode gowork module\n\nMove the node implementation (internal slices, cmd binaries, e2e suite, and\ndocs) out of the tooling root module into a dedicated yacynode module so the\nnode's runtime dependency graph is isolated from the workspace's lint/build\ntooling. Rewrite internal import paths, repoint .go-arch-lint.yml components,\nthe Makefile module loop and targets, the Dockerfile build path, and the e2e\nmodule's relative replace paths. The e2e suite stays a separate GOWORK=off\nmodule, so its docker/testcontainers dependencies remain confined to its own\ngo.mod and never enter the node binary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n", "verified_at": "2026-06-24T17:13:01Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nikitakarpei/my-yacy-node/commits/e8f247a23fb09908c29542c8643156e8926c5fd7", "html_url": "https://github.com/nikitakarpei/my-yacy-node/commit/e8f247a23fb09908c29542c8643156e8926c5fd7", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nikitakarpei/my-yacy-node/commits/e8f247a23fb09908c29542c8643156e8926c5fd7/comments", "author": {"login": "nikitakarpei", "id": 205461907, "node_id": "U_kgDODD8Zkw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205461907?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/nikitakarpei", "html_url": "https://github.com/nikitakarpei", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nikitakarpei/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nikitakarpei/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nikitakarpei/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nikitakarpei/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nikitakarpei/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nikitakarpei/orgs", "repos_url": "htt